                                                "text": "Ultimately, Greenfield may remind us of no one so much as Boston's own, Sylvia Sidney — \"herself\" in the amusement business! From whom else does one expect so leveling a sequence of eruptions: \"i mean yah gotta win a little money/ i mean we're all whores turning a trick\"?"
